<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Sept CPI up 0.9 pct mo/mo, +5.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak Sept CPI up 0.9 pct mo/mo, +5.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak consumer prices rose 0.9 percent in September, putting prices 5.2 percent higher than in September 1995, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK CONSUMER INFLATION  Sept '96   Aug '96    Sept '95</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo		0.9	  0.5	  1.4</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		5.2	  5.6	  8.8</p>
<p>Details of Slovak September inflation:</p>
<p>Foodstuffs</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	2.2	  0.5	   3.5</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  2.8	  4.1	   8.1</p>
<p>Non-food items</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	0.4	  0.5	   0.5</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  6.6	  6.7	   8.3</p>
<p>Public catering</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	0.6	  0.3	   0.7</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  5.5	  5.5	  11.0</p>
<p>Services</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	0.6	  1.0	   0.3</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  4.8	  4.6	   9.8</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3688</p>
</text>
